      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "At a local office, Priya noticed that many colleagues ate lunch at their desks. A staff survey mentioned fatigue, long meetings and a lack of nearby green space. The manager asked a small group to suggest changes that might improve wellbeing without making the working day longer.",
