      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Priya avoided promising that one activity would prevent illness. A sedentary routine may be associated with several difficulties, but an office survey cannot establish a diagnosis. The group focused on practical choices: a quiet room, a proper lunch break and an optional walk. Participation would remain voluntary.",
        "zh": "普里娅没有承诺某项活动能够预防疾病。久坐的日常安排可能与某些问题相关，但办公室调查无法作出诊断。小组着眼于实际选择：安静房间、完整午休和自愿参加的散步。参与会保持自愿。",
