      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "There were a few concerns about the plan. Some employees had mobility needs, and others preferred to rest alone. The group therefore offered alternatives. It also requested more reliable ventilation in a crowded room. Each proposal was discussed separately so that a useful change would not depend on joining every activity.",
        "zh": "大家对计划有一些顾虑。有些员工行动不便，另一些人更愿意独自休息，因此小组提供了替代选择。他们也要求改善一个拥挤房间的通风。各项建议分别讨论，以免享受某项有用的改变必须以参加所有活动为条件。",
        "start": 105.48,
        "voiceEnd": 133.74333333333334,
        "end": 162.00666666666666,
